  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Maths Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A firm foundation in Maths in the Primary years should be non-negotiable. The quality of teaching and learning in Primary Maths in South Africa urgently needs improving.  This project uses existing ICT equipment, innovative maths software, and training, support and mentorship for teachers, principals and district education officials, to improve early grades maths teaching in Western and Northern Cape provinces of South Africa. The project will generate evidence that supports and informs the wider uptake of the model nationally.</narrative>
  </description>
